#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:1
msgid "Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct"
msgstr "Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:3
msgid "1 Introduction"
msgstr "1.简介"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:5
msgid ""
"Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct is a large-scale sparse MoE vision-language "
"model in the Qwen3-VL family. It is designed for multimodal chat, image "
"understanding, multi-image reasoning, OCR-like visual question answering,"
" and long-context generation."
msgstr ""
"Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct 是 Qwen3-VL 系列中的大规模稀疏 MoE 视觉语言模型。"
"它专为多模态对话、图像理解、多图像推理、类OCR视觉问答以及长上下文生成而设计。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:7
msgid ""
"This document describes the main validation steps for the model, "
"including supported features, prerequisites, installation, single-node "
"online deployment, multi-node deployment, Prefill-Decode (PD) "
"disaggregation, functional verification, accuracy and performance "
"evaluation, performance tuning, and FAQs."
msgstr ""
"本文档描述了该模型的主要验证步骤，包括支持的特性、前提条件、安装、单节点在线部署、"
"多节点部署、Prefill-Decode (PD) 分离、功能验证、精度与性能评估、性能调优以及常见问题解答。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:9
msgid ""
"The `Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct` tutorial was introduced in the vLLM-"
"Ascend validation cycle around `v0.12.0`. Use the current `vllm-ascend` "
"documentation image placeholder or a later release for the examples "
"below."
msgstr ""
"`Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct` 教程是在 vLLM-Ascend 验证周期中于 `v0.12.0` 版本左右引入的。"
"请使用当前 `vllm-ascend` 文档镜像占位符或更高版本进行以下示例操作。"

