#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:610
msgid "10 FAQ\n"
msgstr "10 常见问题解答\n"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:612
msgid ""
"For common environment, installation, and general parameter issues, refer"
" to [Public FAQs](../../faqs.md). This section only covers model-specific"
" issues for Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.\n"
msgstr ""
"关于常见环境、安装和通用参数问题，请参考[公共常见问题解答](../../faqs.md)。本节仅涵盖 Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct 的模型特定问题。\n"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:614
msgid ""
"Q1: Why does the service report OOM during startup or soon after "
"accepting requests?\n"
msgstr ""
"Q1：为什么服务在启动期间或接受请求后不久报告 OOM？\n"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:616
msgid ""
"**Phenomenon:** The service fails during profile run, or it starts "
"successfully but reports OOM when real traffic arrives.\n"
msgstr ""
"**现象：** 服务在 profile 运行期间失败，或者成功启动但在真实流量到达时报告 OOM。\n"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:618
msgid ""
"**Cause:** Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct has high weight, KV cache, and "
"multimodal preprocessing memory requirements. Large `--max-model-len`, "
"large `--max-num-seqs`, large `--max-num-batched-tokens`, high image "
"resolution, too many images per prompt, or high `--gpu-memory-"
"utilization` can leave insufficient HBM headroom.\n"
msgstr ""
"**原因：** Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct 具有较高的权重、KV 缓存和多模态预处理内存需求。较大的 `--max-model-len`、较大的 `--max-num-seqs`、较大的 `--max-num-batched-tokens`、高图像分辨率、每个提示中图像过多或较高的 `--gpu-memory-utilization` 可能导致 HBM 余量不足。\n"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:620
msgid ""
"**Solution:** Use the W8A8 model with `--quantization ascend` when "
"possible, lower `--max-model-len`, lower `--max-num-seqs`, lower `--max-"
"num-batched-tokens`, lower image/video limits, or reduce `--gpu-memory-"
"utilization`. Keep `PYTORCH_NPU_ALLOC_CONF=expandable_segments:True`.\n"
msgstr ""
"**解决方案：** 尽可能使用带有 `--quantization ascend` 的 W8A8 模型，降低 `--max-model-len`，降低 `--max-num-seqs`，降低 `--max-num-batched-tokens`，降低图像/视频限制，或减少 `--gpu-memory-utilization`。保持 `PYTORCH_NPU_ALLOC_CONF=expandable_segments:True`。\n"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:622
msgid "Q2: Why does multi-node MP deployment hang during initialization?\n"
msgstr "Q2：为什么多节点 MP 部署在初始化期间挂起？\n"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:624
msgid ""
"**Phenomenon:** One node waits for other ranks, HCCL initialization times"
" out, or the headless node exits.\n"
msgstr ""
"**现象：** 一个节点等待其他 rank，HCCL 初始化超时，或 headless 节点退出。\n"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:626
msgid ""
"**Cause:** Network interface names, IP addresses, DP ranks, or RPC ports "
"are inconsistent across nodes.\n"
msgstr ""
"**原因：** 节点间的网络接口名称、IP 地址、DP rank 或 RPC 端口不一致。\n"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:628
msgid ""
"**Solution:** Verify multi-node communication first. Ensure `HCCL_IF_IP`,"
" `GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME`, `TP_SOCKET_IFNAME`, and `HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME` match"
" the selected NIC. Ensure all nodes use the same `--data-parallel-rpc-"
"port`, non-master nodes use `--headless`, and `--data-parallel-start-"
"rank` does not overlap.\n"
msgstr ""
"**解决方案：** 首先验证多节点通信。确保 `HCCL_IF_IP`、`GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME`、`TP_SOCKET_IFNAME` 和 `HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME` 与所选 NIC 匹配。确保所有节点使用相同的 `--data-parallel-rpc-port`，非主节点使用 `--headless`，并且 `--data-parallel-start-rank` 不重叠。\n"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:630
msgid "Q3: Why is video disabled in the image-only examples?\n"
msgstr "Q3：为什么在仅图像示例中禁用了视频？\n"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:632
msgid ""
"**Phenomenon:** The service reserves more memory than expected, or "
"startup OOM occurs even when requests only contain images.\n"
msgstr ""
"**现象：** 服务预留的内存超出预期，或者即使请求仅包含图像，也会发生启动 OOM。\n"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:634
msgid ""
"**Cause:** Allowing video inputs can reserve memory for long visual "
"embeddings and preprocessing paths that are not needed by image-only "
"workloads.\n"
msgstr ""
"**原因：** 允许视频输入可能会为仅图像工作负载不需要的长视觉嵌入和预处理路径预留内存。\n"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:636
msgid ""
"**Solution:** Use `--limit-mm-per-prompt.video 0` for image-only serving."
" Enable video only when your workload needs it, and lower `--max-model-"
"len` or request concurrency if needed.\n"
msgstr ""
"**解决方案：** 对于仅图像服务，使用 `--limit-mm-per-prompt.video 0`。仅在工作负载需要时启用视频，并在必要时降低 `--max-model-len` 或请求并发数。\n"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:638
msgid "Q4: Why does enabling prefix caching not improve performance?\n"
msgstr "Q4：为什么启用前缀缓存没有提高性能？\n"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:640
msgid ""
"**Phenomenon:** Prefix caching is enabled, but throughput or latency does"
" not improve.\n"
msgstr ""
"**现象：** 已启用前缀缓存，但吞吐量或延迟没有改善。\n"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:642
msgid ""
"**Cause:** Prefix caching only helps when requests share reusable "
"prefixes. Random prompts, unique images, or low cache hit rates may add "
"memory pressure without visible gains.\n"
msgstr ""
"**原因：** 前缀缓存仅在请求共享可重用前缀时才有帮助。随机提示、唯一图像或低缓存命中率可能会增加内存压力而没有明显收益。\n"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:644
msgid ""
"**Solution:** Enable prefix caching for repeated-prefix workloads. For "
"random benchmark datasets, memory-constrained long-context workloads, or "
"PD validation, compare with `--no-enable-prefix-caching`.\n"
msgstr ""
"**解决方案：** 为重复前缀工作负载启用前缀缓存。对于随机基准数据集、内存受限的长上下文工作负载或 PD 验证，请与 `--no-enable-prefix-caching` 进行对比。\n"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:646
msgid "Q5: Why does PD disaggregation fail to transfer KV cache?\n"
msgstr "Q5：为什么 PD 分离部署无法传输 KV 缓存？\n"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:648
msgid ""
"**Phenomenon:** Requests reach the proxy or prefill service, but decode "
"nodes do not produce output or report KV transfer errors.\n"
msgstr ""
"**现象：** 请求到达代理或预填充服务，但解码节点不产生输出或报告 KV 传输错误。\n"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:650
msgid ""
"**Cause:** The Mooncake connector ports, producer/consumer roles, or "
"`kv_connector_extra_config` DP/TP sizes do not match the actual topology.\n"
msgstr ""
"**原因：** Mooncake 连接器端口、生产者/消费者角色或 `kv_connector_extra_config` 的 DP/TP 大小与实际拓扑不匹配。\n"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:652
msgid ""
"**Solution:** Check `kv_role`, `kv_port`, and the prefill/decode DP/TP "
"sizes on all nodes. Start from the validated topology in Section 5.4, "
"then change one dimension at a time.\n"
msgstr ""
"**解决方案：** 检查所有节点上的 `kv_role`、`kv_port` 以及预填充/解码的 DP/TP 大小。从第 5.4 节中验证过的拓扑开始，然后一次更改一个维度。\n"

